        {
            "id": "a002_021_0012",
            "en_US": [
                "Using infrared, you can battle and trade\n",
                "with a friend in front of you.\n",
                "You can also use the Feeling Check which\n",
                "tells you how compatible you and your\n",
                "friend are, and exchange Friend Codes."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_021_0013",
            "en_US": [
                "By pressing the Game Sync button,\n",
                "you can select a Pokémon to make sleep\n",
                "and then send your saved data over\n",
                "Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_021_0014",
            "en_US": [
                "You cannot connect to Nintendo Wi-Fi\n",
                "Connection without the proper\n",
                "system settings, even when you are\n",
                "able to receive a signal for \n",
                "Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_021_0015",
            "en_US": [
                "DS Wireless Communications\n",
                "allow you to use the features below\n",
                "with your nearby friends.\n",
                "-Xtransceiver\n",
                "-Entralink"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_021_0016",
            "en_US": [
                "The Xtransceiver allows you to connect\n",
                "with friends you've played with in the\n",
                "Wi-Fi Club or those you've exchanged\n",
                "Friend Codes with using the C-Gear."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_021_0017",
            "en_US": [
                "Press the button, and you will be\n",
                "sent to the Entralink instantly."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_021_0018",
            "en_US": [
                "You can tell how many people\n",
                "are in the Union Room around you\n",
                "and if wireless distributions\n",
                "are available nearby."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_021_0019",
            "en_US": [
                "You can also tell who has\n",
                "the C-Gear turned on around you.\n",
                "When people are nearby,\n",
                "it is easier to receive signals for\n",
                "the Tag Log and Survey Radar."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_021_0020",
            "en_US": [
                "It displays what people\n",
                "around you are doing in real time.\n",
                "By selecting it, you can find out\n",
                "more about them and send\n",
                "them messages."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_021_0021",
            "en_US": [
                "You can do surveys on people\n",
                "around you.\n",
                "\n",
                "Choose what you want to find out,\n",
                "and you can see the daily results,\n",
                "as well as the cumulative results."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_021_0022",
            "en_US": [
                "Touch the Customization icon, and it will\n",
                "start blinking. Touch other buttons as it\n",
                "blinks, and they will appear differently.\n",
                "\n",
                "You can even make patterns with buttons\n",
                "of different colors."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_021_0023",
            "en_US": [
                "Touch this button to turn\n",
                "wireless communications on or off.\n",
                "\n",
                "Once you turn it off, the touch panel\n",
                "turns dark, and wireless communications\n",
                "will be turned off."
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
